			<div class="content" id="post-content-3668695">
									

<p>This is a rewrite of my first SCP, which was based off the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_Man_of_the_Lake">Old Man of the Lake</a>, which is a real thing. Most of the things mentioned in this article are actually based on real things. The 1988 event actually occured, and is mentioned on the Wikipedia page. The mythology is based on a <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Llao">myth</a> of the Klamath. One of the stories that Lance Owens tells at the end is based on a story told to me by a family friend about the time he visited Crater Lake. The UFO the ASCI was chasing after was based on the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mystery_airship">mystery airships</a> that were around in the 1890s.</p>
<p>The original version of this can be found in the files at the bottom of the page. My main problem with the original was that it wasn't original enough - this has a lot more original content, while preserving the fact that a large amount of it is a real thing.</p>
<p>The image is from <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Crater_Lake_Old_Man_of_the_Lake.jpg">here</a> and is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 Unported License.</p>
