<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Mount&nbsp;Mazama&nbsp;erupted&nbsp;recently&nbsp;enough&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp;Klamath&nbsp;saw&nbsp;it&nbsp;and&nbsp;incorporated&nbsp;it&nbsp;into&nbsp;their&nbsp;mythology.</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>They attributed that eruption to the work of Llao.</p>
<p>Now reread the last Sigma event.</p>
