<p>The update with the figures in the mist and the implication that this cold war between the two gods is escalating again made an already interesting SCP a lot stronger. Nice to see a Foundation operative showing initiative by proactively reaching out to make updates about a change in an SCP's situation. Plus both the note itself and the idea of an &quot;Office of Tactical Theology&quot; I really, really love.</p>
